Package: tkniModel
Type: Package
Title: Parallel Voxel-wise Modeling and Advanced Visualization for Neuroimaging
Version: 0.2.0
Author: Timothy R. Koscik <tkoscik@uams.edu>
Maintainer: Timothy R. Koscik <tkoscik@uams.edu>
Description: A specialized toolkit for neuroimaging analysis on local and HPC 
    environments. Features include BIDS-compliant file matching, automated 
    scratch I/O management, voxel-wise modeling, cluster thresholding, 
    and high-performance magick-based brain overlays and montages.
